  Vendored weather keys (animated SVG with SMIL):
    weather-clear ← clear-day
    weather-partly ← partly-cloudy-day
    weather-cloud ← cloudy
    weather-fog ← fog
    weather-drizzle ← drizzle
    weather-rain ← rain
    weather-snow ← snow
    weather-storm ← thunderstorms
    weather-sleet ← sleet

  Avalonia.Svg.Skia does not execute SMIL; NotifyIsland mirrors primary
  motion with Avalonia animations (see MeteoconsMotion.cs).

Only icons needed by NotifyIsland keys are vendored.
